    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d458">

                <pb facs="0528" n="424" sameAs="frus:frus1932v03/pg424"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/4376: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland (Wilson) to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-02-24T10:00:00+01:00">February 24, 1932—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 24—6:18 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>34. If and when you take action contemplated in your 19, February 20, 2 p.m.,
                    Simon who returns this morning will presumably notify Council. Would you
                    contemplate authorizing me to make such notification at the same time to
                    Drummond in writing as a further evidence of our desire to cooperate with the
                    Council and to keep it fully advised?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
